Find out if it's cursed. If it is, name it "bad" and throw it away. If it
isn't, lock yourself in a closet and try it on. If there's no immediate
effect, wait a couple of hundred turns. If you don't sleep, strangle, or
change sex, then it's a good amulet.

All you need is a pet or an altar.

An alternative is to throw the amulet at a tool-using monster, then zap a
wand at it, throw something poisonous at it, and kill it. You waste a
life-saving amulet that way, tho. The other way is much better.
